<div class="post">
<h2>January 16, 2006</h2>


<h1 id="a000075">Trapped in La Libertad</h1>

<p><a href="http://www.flickr.com/photos/theroadislife/86909054/" title="Photo Sharing"><img src="http://static.flickr.com/36/86909054_1d1de31d79_m.jpg" width="240" height="180" hspace="10" vspace="10" align="right" alt="La Libertad in the Afternoon" /></a>Trapped in La Libertad.  There is irony somewhere in that statement.</p>

<p>Brian has developed a heat rash from his fever and opted for the doctors office instead of the 2000m climb to San Salvador.   She specifically advised against attempting the bike ride, though I suspect she´d advise against it under any circumstances.  He´s fine really (he´ll tell you that himself)...  we hope to be on the road tomorrow at the crack of dawn.</p>

<p>For now though, it looks like it´ll be another day lounging in my hammock and rolling around in the near-perfect surf.   Woe is me.</p>



